@startuml
title Touch action communication

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

object User
object "ST77922_TOUCH" as Touch
object "monitorTouchInput\n(touch coroutine)" as TouchTask
object "InteractionController" as Interaction
object "TouchDispatcher" as Dispatcher
object "Queue<UiAction, 8>" as Queue
object "processUiActions\n(application coroutine)" as Application
object "UiActionProcessor" as Processor
object "ControllerModel" as Model
object "ControllerMessages" as Messages
object "updateLighting\n(lighting coroutine)" as LightingTask
object "LightingOutput" as Lighting
object "updateEffectUi\n(UI coroutine)" as UiTask
object "UiRenderer" as Renderer

User --> Touch : 1: press / move / release
TouchTask --> Touch : 2: sample contact
TouchTask --> Interaction : 3: poll(now, actions)
Interaction --> Dispatcher : 3.1: update contact + tick
Dispatcher --> Interaction : 3.2: return up to two UiAction values
Interaction --> TouchTask : 3.3: return ordered action batch
TouchTask --> Queue : 4: send(action)\n(suspends on backpressure)
Queue --> Application : 5: receive()
Application --> Processor : 6: process(action, now)
Processor --> Model : 6.1: mutate steady-state model
Processor --> Messages : 6.2: publish coalesced effects
Messages --> LightingTask : 7: takeLighting()
LightingTask --> Lighting : 7.1: apply latest model state
LightingTask --> Messages : 7.2: publish UI invalidation\nafter output is current
Messages --> UiTask : 8: takeUi()
UiTask --> Renderer : 8.1: redraw dirty elements once
Renderer --> User : 8.2: flush framebuffer

note bottom of Queue
  Semantic actions are lossless and FIFO.
  Continuous rendering state coalesces only
  after the application task processes them.
end note

note bottom of Model
  PersistentState restores startup values
  before these runtime tasks are spawned.
end note
@enduml
